    "description": {
      "value": "<p>In addition to the benefits of the Paladin's Faithful Steed feature, when you cast Find Steed, the Otherworldly Steed can be Undead. An Undead steed deals Necrotic damage with its Otherworldly Slam and gains the following Bonus Action:</p><p><strong>Ghostly Stride (Undead Only; Recharges after a Long Rest).</strong> The steed and its rider can move through other creatures and objects this turn as if they were Difficult Terrain. Both take 5 (1d10) Force damage if they end their turn inside an object.</p>",
